## Context
Source: Fable (claude-fable-5-1) and Astra (gpt-6-astra) review of the ruleset, 2026-11-01; reports in the session scratchpad, findings verified against main by the session. Both reviewers, independently: `rules/workflow.md` (resident, the largest
body, ~11 000 chars) carries procedure that belongs in skills. Estimated
savings 2 500-3 000 resident chars with no rule lost:
- § Escalation protocol (numbered steps, 5-minute timings, build-each-option-and-gaze) -> route skill; keep "the author's calls by right wait; reversible calls go to an advisor first".
- § Diagnosis discipline elaboration -> a reference the gaze/raid/doctor skills point to; keep the four one-line principles. Astra: the heuristic "deterministic or independently reproduced ... points toward intended behaviour" is a logic error (ordinary bugs are deterministic); separate confirming the observation from evidence of intent.
- § Session start: naming table, pid recipe, presentation line -> hunt § Worktree / a startup reference; keep the isolation principle and its exceptions. Astra: "Before answering, create a worktree" and "Run to the end ... merge" conflict with read-only skills (dashboard) and skills that end before merge (hunt, smelt).
- § Monster ticket -> hunt decomposition; keep the signal.
- Duplicates to resolve: project-memory boundary (workflow.md § Worktree paths, guards.md, AGENTS.md); reviewer independence (workflow.md says high risk "needs" another family, decorrelation.md says no gate refuses for want of one).
- Scoped gate (§ Check scope) vs verify-gate's narrower eligibility.

## Shape
Interactive with the author, like the 2026-11-01 git.md pass: the author
edits in the primary checkout, the session proposes cuts with char counts. Not
delegated: this is the rule text read in every session.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] workflow.md keeps principles only; moved procedure lands in the named skills in the same change
- [ ] Resident budget re-ratcheted to the new measured total
- [ ] The two contradictions (independence, completion endpoint) are settled in one place
